[00:00.00] 作曲 : Joybeth Taylor/Johnny Clawson
[00:00.00][by:SKT_FlockaFlame]
[00:12.06]I wouldn’t paint me as a heart breaker
[00:12.06]我不会自诩为负心之人
[00:14.97]But i’ve said a few goodbyes
[00:14.97]但确实说过几次告别
[00:18.23]I’d make a promise but i know later
[00:18.23]想许下承诺 却心知肚明
[00:21.18]I’m bound to change my mind
[00:21.18]自己迟早又会改变主意
[00:24.49]Depending on the weather im goin’
[00:24.49]去留全凭天气变幻
[00:27.65]Hell baby nobody knows when
[00:27.65]亲爱的 连风都不知归期
[00:30.83]Yeah if it was a different time
[00:30.83]若是在不同的时空里
[00:33.93]Might have been different in a different life
[00:33.93]或许会有不同的结局
[00:37.19]
[00:37.34]Maybe that plane wouldn’t ever take off
[00:37.34]也许那架飞机永远不会起飞
[00:40.22]Maybe that dust wouldn’t fly off the drive
[00:40.22]车道扬尘也不会随风飘散
[00:43.46]Maybe that tumbleweed and me wouldn’t leave every other sunrise
[00:43.46]或许风滚草与我不会在每个黎明前离去
[00:50.62]Maybe i’d settle down dig in some roots
[00:50.62]也许我会扎根某处 安定下来
[00:53.81]Find me a farmhouse find me you
[00:53.81]寻间农舍 寻到你身影
[00:57.63]Maybe i wouldn’t be already gone again
[00:57.63]或许此刻我就不会再次启程
[01:03.17]If it weren’t for the wind
[01:03.17]若非那阵风
[01:06.12]
